cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Resource Constrained Shortest Path Problem Instances with Time Windows, Capacity, and Neighbourhoods"
abstract: >-
  A dataset of Resource Constrained Shortest Path Problem (RCSPP) instances with time windows,
  vehicle capacity, and vertex neighbourhoods. The instances are generated as the root-node
  pricing problems that arise when solving the 56 Solomon VRPTW instances by column generation;
  three instances (neighbourhood sizes N8, N16, N24) are provided per Solomon instance, in a
  DIMACS-like .graph format.
authors:
